  protocol v4 W1 regressions
    A01: Liquidation always has an authorised exit
      √ records partial recovery entry by entry and closes as LossSettled without early release
      √ closes full recovery as Repaid and a zero-recovery liquidation as LossSettled
      √ returns an unsubscribed liquidation to Cancelled and releases the pledge
    A02: every Frozen combination has a defined exit
      √ lets an unsubscribed frozen offering cancel, and a subscribed one settle after full recovery
      √ lets a frozen overdue offering default and an evidenced unfreeze restore the prior state
    A05/A06: approved terms and subscription cutoff are on-chain from creation
      √ binds maturity and deadline atomically and refuses inconsistent terms
      √ refuses subscriptions after the deadline and keeps the maturity/deadline order when shortened
    A07: quote freshness, version and order are enforced on-chain
      √ rejects expired, too-far, stale, replayed and wrong-version quotes
      √ does not let a quote prepared before a reprice overwrite the new price
    A08: subscription is bound to price, version and deadline
      √ accepts only the approved price/version/deadline and rejects drift atomically

